~ start
(You look for a note...)
Ivy: ...
(You found a note!)
Ivy: There!
=> read

~ read
Ivy: There's 2 notes... Which do I read?
- First one [if GameState.read_note_1 == false]
	set GameState.read_note_1 = true
	Ivy: Let's read the first note.
	I am Ivy. It is January 4.
	Me and my friends go back to the first of January every time.
	If I'm correct, we're in the 11th loop right now.
	If you see this Ivy, it means you're in the 14th loop.
	I received messages that told me to look for notes in certain places.
	At the start of January, we went outside, and I found the notes there.
	If what I read is correct, then I'll go back to the 1st of January when the clock hits 12.
	So whenever it turns January 5, we will all go back to January 1, and I'll lose my memories.
	Please, figure something out Ivy.
	-Ivy, 11th Loop.
	=> read
- Second one [if GameState.read_note_2 == false]
	set GameState.read_note_2 = true
	Hi!!! I am Ivy and it is February 10, 2026!
	I work at CDD, the best Science and Technology company in the world!
	Me and my team have succeeded in creating the time machine!
	The president of CDD, my father, is going to send me and my team for testing.
	We were required to list our observings on these notes.
	We chose to time leap to January 1.
	We all want to experience the fireworks again.
	That week was the best week ever.
	On January 1, we immediately went outside and watched the fireworks!
	Then the next day, we immediately travelled to another country!
	The start of the year could never be more fun.
	What makes it better is that we had no school days!
	I'm really excited to see what this time leap will do.
	We're about to enter the time machine in 30 minutes! I'm so excited!
	We're very well prepared!
	-Ivy, Start of Time Leap.
	=>  read
- I've read both.. [if GameState.read_note_1 == true and GameState.read_note_2 == true]
	=> finish
	
~ finish
Ivy: ...
Ivy: Wait, there's another note on the bed...
(You read the note.)
I am Ivy. I am from the 12th Loop.
I found it. I found something that might stop this.
I can send messages to the future.
I've read the notes. It seems that the notes aren't affected by the time loop.
But I've found something better. 
I can send messages through my phone.
I don't have much time to explain.
The Ivy from the 12th loop found something out.
All of your friends are aware of the time loop.
It's only you that loses your memories.
I lost that note of the 12th loop, but it doesn't matter.
I'll make this note for the 13th loop.
Once you find this Ivy, I need you to send messages yourself.
That phone of yours has weird properties.
I suspect that it was modified while you were in the time machine.
I'm really running out of time, so to make you believe me Ivy.
P4546. Re404. Khara. Time.
-Ivy, 12th Loop.

Ivy: ...
Ivy: ...
Ivy: That was my codeword...
Ivy: I've had that codeword for years, and I've made sure no one could ever know it.
Ivy: This is a lot to take in.
Ivy: It even has my signature perfectly...
Ivy: Okay..okay... 
Ivy: I am logical and smart, I need to think this through.
Ivy: I need to assess how truthful this can be...
Ivy: But if this is true, then I've lost my memories...
Ivy: How will I confirm this?
Ivy: Forget it... think logically Ivy...
(You take some time to assess the possibility of the notes being true.)
do SceneTransition.change_scene("res://scenes/Levels/level_8.tscn")
=> END